<div class="page">
  <div class="content-section">
    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">A Typical Day:</h2>
    <p>Each week the campers will experience a different theme. Sports, Outdoor Adventure, Water, and Wellness. The weekly theme includes four themed special activities and a field trip in addition to swimming, climbing, group fitness, and playing various sports. Exposure to a broad range of activities keeps campers engaged and wanting more. Your child's day will be filled with activity and fun.</p>

    <h2 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Field Trips:</h2>
    <p>The Mocs Adventure Camp features one themed field trip per week. Most field trips require an additional waiver to be signed by the parent(s) or guardian(s). This waiver will be emailed to the parent(s) or guardian(s) prior to the start of camp each week. The camper will not be able to participate in camp on Friday if the waiver is not completed.</p>
    <p>Transportation to and from the field trip location will be by school bus, chartered through the Chattanooga Bus Company. All drivers have a minimum of two years bus driving experience.</p>
    <p>Campers are required to wear their camp t-shirt on field trip days. This allows us to easily keep our group together.</p>

    <h3 style="font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 20px;">Field Trips:</h3>
    <ul style="list-style-type: disc; padding-left: 20px;">
      <li><strong>Sports Week</strong> – June {{ start_date_field_trip_sports }} – June {{ end_date_field_trip_sports }} – The Chattanooga Jump Park</li>
      <li><strong>Outdoor Adventure Week</strong> – June {{ start_date_field_trip_outdoor }} – June {{ end_date_field_trip_outdoor }} – Sunset Rock Hiking Trip</li>
      <li><strong>Water Week</strong> – June {{ start_date_field_trip_water }} – June {{ end_date_field_trip_water }} – Nooga Splash and Chester Frost Park</li>
      <li><strong>Wellness Week</strong> – June {{ start_date_field_trip_wellness }} – July {{ end_date_field_trip_wellness }} – Hamilton Skating Rink</li>
      <li><strong>Outdoor Adventure Week</strong> – July {{ start_date_field_trip_outdoor2 }} – July {{ end_date_field_trip_outdoor2 }} – Cloudland Canyon Hiking and Caving</li>
      <li><strong>Water Week</strong> – July {{ start_date_field_trip_water2 }} – July {{ end_date_field_trip_water2 }} – The Tennessee Aquarium</li>
      <li><strong>Sports Week</strong> – July {{ start_date_field_trip_sports2 }} – July {{ end_date_field_trip_sports2 }} – Top Golf</li>
    </ul>
  </div>

